    {
      "name": "prepare_local_upload",
      "description": "For a Codex local image, first run installed triverse-mcp-local-upload inspect on the host. Prepare with that filename, MIME, size, SHA-256, an input session and stable attempt_id; never send a local path or bytes. On UPLOAD_REQUIRED, pass this transient lease by private stdin to triverse-mcp-local-upload put.",
